{% import 'macros/ui.html.twig' as ui %}
<section class="section faq-layout" data-controller="faq" data-reveal-target="item">
    <div class="faq-intro">
        <div class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</div>
        <h2>Answers to<br>your questions</h2>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ path('app_contact') }}">Contact us {{ ui.icon('arrow') }}</a>
    </div>
    <div>
        <details class="faq-item" data-faq-target="item" data-action="toggle->faq#toggle">
            <summary>What types of profiles do you provide?</summary>
            <p>We provide experienced external consultants in finance, compliance, risk management and digital transformation. Every profile is carefully selected and validated before we introduce them.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" data-faq-target="item" data-action="toggle->faq#toggle">
            <summary>How quickly will we receive suitable profiles?</summary>
            <p>We aim to present suitable profiles within 48 hours, with personalised follow-up tailored to your specific needs.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" data-faq-target="item" data-action="toggle->faq#toggle">
            <summary>What are your areas of expertise?</summary>
            <p>Our expertise covers compliance, AML/CFT, MiFID, DORA, MiCA, cybersecurity and digital transformation. We also support strategic training and business development.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" data-faq-target="item" data-action="toggle->faq#toggle">
            <summary>Are the consultants already available?</summary>
            <p>Yes. Our consultants are already vetted and validated. We confirm their availability before presenting them to ensure a fast start.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item" data-faq-target="item" data-action="toggle->faq#toggle">
            <summary>Do you only work in Luxembourg?</summary>
            <p>No. We also operate in Belgium and across Europe. Our consultants are mobile and experienced in international environments.</p>
        </details>
    </div>
</section>
